    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** CardCash marketplace activity hit multi-year highs in buy orders, average order value and new seller acquisition, signalling strong consumer appetite and deepening platform liquidity. Improved fraud detection allowed more legitimate transactions to flow through, further boosting approved order volumes. With the gift card exchange as the primary driver and complementary incentive platforms like Restaurant.com in tow, the business appears to be riding a resurgent end-market for discounted gift cards, showing broad-based operational momentum.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** The team has invested in proprietary fraud models, automated screening and external risk data partnerships, sharply cutting false declines and improving customer throughput. Combined with disciplined cost control and lower interest expense, these moves are steadily narrowing losses while CardCash scales. The latest quarterly update demonstrates successful execution of a turnaround playbook, reinforcing management’s credibility as the marketplace metrics and financial trajectory align.",
